# Netrunner — deploy overlay

Platform OIDC / Environments: `app-deploy`.

- Workflow: `.github/workflows/deploy-netrunner.yml`
- Site paths: `netrunner/**` (and the workflow file itself) trigger S3 sync
- Tests under `tests/` always run when those paths (or the workflow) change
- `SITE_HOST` GitHub Environment var: `netrunner-stg.7oas7er.com` or `netrunner.7oas7er.com`
- Sync excludes `README.md`; HTML short cache; JS/CSS long immutable cache (`?v=` bump required)
